<component type="operating-system">
  <id>org.tenko.Tenko</id>
  <name>Tenko Linux</name>
  <summary>X11/XFCE workstation distribution</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Tenko Linux 6 (Workstation) is an X11/XFCE distribution built from
      source with a merged-/usr layout, systemd, D-Bus and the freedesktop
      desktop stack.  It ships the XFCE session, Thunar, the freedesktop
      portal backend and Flatpak, with a Tenko package repository for
      independent package updates.
    </p>
  </description>
